      "status": "independently reviewed",
      "correspondence": "The global theta host requires an inert-class or signal prime. It obtains the genus-one model at this fixed embedding before choosing orthonormal bases. Entry estimates use a further level-free hypothesis. The local example starts with I=(5) and ends with I′=𝒪_K in K=ℚ(√−23).",
